# The pixi version this workspace is solved and installed with, on a workstation and on a
# runner alike. TomBorglum/actions/direnv/setup evaluates this file and `use pixi` puts that
# exact pixi, and the environment it installs, on PATH - the workflows install none of their
# own.
#
# fixture-pixi-outdated/.envrc is a separate workspace with a separate pin. It is a fixture
# for _test-update-pixi-dependencies.yml and is deliberately left behind; do not align it
# with this one.
use pixi 0.84.2
